<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Why MedhaIQ | MedhaIQ.ai</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Why MedhaIQ exists: the philosophy behind Continuous Career Intelligence, and how it's built into every interview, score, and session.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0A0F1E">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/medhaiq.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/components.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/hero-v2.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/value-footer.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/why.css">
</head>
<body class="mh-why-body">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <!-- ============================================
       01 — HERO (DARK THEME)
       ============================================ -->
  <%- include('partials/page-hero', {
    eyebrow: 'WHY MEDHAIQ',
    title: 'Why MedhaIQ Exists',
    sub: 'Interview preparation shouldn\'t be a one-time event. It should be Continuous Career Intelligence.'
  }) %>

  <!-- ============================================
       WARM LIGHT EDITORIAL CANVAS (#F7F6F2)
       ============================================ -->
  <main class="mh-why-main-light">

    <!-- ============================================
         02 — PROBLEM & SHIFT (2 CARDS)
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="mh-why-twocard">
      <div class="mh-why-container">
        <div class="mh-why-twocard-grid">

          <!-- CARD 1: THE PROBLEM -->
          <div class="mh-why-card">
            <div class="mh-why-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/>
                <path d="M12 8v4M12 16h.01"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="mh-eyebrow">THE PROBLEM</div>
            <h2 class="mh-why-card-title">The Transactional Trap</h2>
            <div class="mh-why-card-body">
              <p class="mh-why-card-text">Most interview preparation is optimized for a single event. Once the interview ends, the learning disappears with it.</p>
              <p class="mh-why-card-text">The next opportunity starts from zero — again.</p>
              <p class="mh-why-card-text mh-why-card-text-bold">That's the transactional trap.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CARD 2: THE PARADIGM SHIFT -->
          <div class="mh-why-card">
            <div class="mh-why-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/>
                <polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="mh-eyebrow">THE PARADIGM SHIFT</div>
            <h2 class="mh-why-card-title">From Cramming to Progression</h2>
            <div class="mh-why-card-body">
              <p class="mh-why-card-text">Traditional prep is episodic: one script, one outcome, then it's gone.</p>
              <p class="mh-why-card-text">MedhaIQ treats readiness as something built, not crammed — each session compounding into the next. Not a single verdict. A growth curve.</p>
              <p class="mh-why-card-text mh-why-card-text-bold">That's the shift: from a test survived once, to a skill that keeps compounding.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================
         03 — MANIFESTO / POSITIONING QUOTE
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="mh-why-philosophy">
      <div class="mh-why-narrow">
        <div class="mh-why-quote-card">
          <div class="mh-quote-mark-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="mh-why-quote">
            Professionals don't need another answer generator. <span class="mh-why-quote-blue">They need a better thinking system.</span>
          </blockquote>
          <p class="mh-why-quote-sub">
            Our objective isn't helping someone pass one isolated interview; it's helping someone become the kind of professional who naturally succeeds in every interview.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================
         04 — THREE PILLARS
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="mh-why-pillars">
      <div class="mh-why-container">
        <div class="mh-section-center">
          <div class="mh-eyebrow">HOW IT'S BUILT</div>
          <h2 class="mh-section-title">The Three Pillars</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mh-why-pillar-grid">

          <!-- PILLAR 1 -->
          <div class="mh-why-pillar-card">
            <span class="mh-pillar-icon-inline mh-pillar-icon-amber" aria-hidden="true">⚡</span>
            <h3 class="mh-why-pillar-title">Real-Time Stress Testing</h3>
            <p class="mh-why-pillar-desc">
              Pressure reveals what rehearsal hides. MedhaIQ recreates real evaluation conditions — live and adaptive — so growth happens under the same conditions it's tested in.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- PILLAR 2 -->
          <div class="mh-why-pillar-card">
            <span class="mh-pillar-icon-inline mh-pillar-icon-blue" aria-hidden="true">☍</span>
            <h3 class="mh-why-pillar-title">5-Vector Intelligence</h3>
            <p class="mh-why-pillar-desc">
              Every response is scored across five dimensions — structure, domain depth, strategic thinking, communication, and leadership — turning one performance into a precise map of strengths and gaps.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- PILLAR 3 -->
          <div class="mh-why-pillar-card">
            <span class="mh-pillar-icon-inline mh-pillar-icon-blue" aria-hidden="true">∞</span
            <h3 class="mh-why-pillar-title">Living Profile of Mastery</h3>
            <p class="mh-why-pillar-desc">
              Progress isn't a single score. It's a living record of how someone thinks, communicates, and executes — evolving with every session.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================
         05 — COMPARISON TABLE
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="mh-why-compare" id="why-compare">
      <div class="mh-why-container">
        <div class="mh-section-center">
          <div class="mh-eyebrow">THE COMPARISON</div>
          <h2 class="mh-section-title">Why We're Different</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mh-why-compare-panel">
          <div class="mh-matrix-table-wrap">
            <table class="mh-matrix-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th class="mh-matrix-th mh-matrix-th-label">CAREER INTELLIGENCE DIMENSION</th>
                  <th class="mh-matrix-th mh-matrix-th-legacy">LEGACY APPROACHES</th>
                  <th class="mh-matrix-th mh-matrix-th-platform">MEDHAIQ PLATFORM</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr class="mh-matrix-row">
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-label">Career Lifecycle</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-legacy">Static one-time preparation</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-platform">
                    <span class="mh-matrix-check">&#10003;</span>
                    Continuous Career Intelligence across your entire career
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="mh-matrix-row">
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-label">Assessment Depth</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-legacy">Basic conversational mock interviews</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-platform">
                    <span class="mh-matrix-check">&#10003;</span>
                    Multi-layered Executive Leadership Readiness simulations
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="mh-matrix-row">
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-label">Personal Brand</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-legacy">Mechanical resume formatting checks</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-platform">
                    <span class="mh-matrix-check">&#10003;</span>
                    Strategic Executive Persona &amp; Personal Brand Development
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="mh-matrix-row">
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-label">Career Strategy</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-legacy">Linear entry-level placement focus</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-platform">
                    <span class="mh-matrix-check">&#10003;</span>
                    Long-term Enterprise &amp; Executive Career Lifecycle
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="mh-matrix-row">
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-label">Leadership Readiness</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-legacy">Fragmented generic coaching</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-platform">
                    <span class="mh-matrix-check">&#10003;</span>
                    Deeply calibrated Global Leadership Readiness Blueprints
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="mh-matrix-row mh-matrix-row-last">
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-label">Continuous Intelligence</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-legacy">No structured feedback</td>
                  <td class="mh-matrix-cell mh-matrix-cell-platform">
                    <span class="mh-matrix-check">&#10003;</span>
                    5-Vector AI Scoring with quantified career diagnostics
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================
         06 — BOTTOM MANIFESTO CARD
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="mh-why-bottom-manifesto">
      <div class="mh-why-narrow">
        <div class="mh-why-manifesto-panel">
          <p class="mh-why-manifesto-text">
            We aren't building another interview platform. We're building the intelligence layer professionals carry throughout their careers—helping them think more clearly, communicate more effectively, and grow with confidence over time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>